{"articleNo":"2724","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2724&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 희망드림(차상위계층) 장학금 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.07","hit":"16368","attachments":[{"name":"2011-1학기_희망드림(차상위계층)_장학금_주요내용.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2724&attachNo=1536"},{"name":"2011년_1학기_희망드림_신청매뉴얼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2724&attachNo=2619"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">2011학년도 1학기 희망드림(차상위계층) 장학금 신청 안내</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"4\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"3\">2011학년도 1학기 희망드림(차상위계층) 장학금 신청을 아래와 같이 안내<br><br>&nbsp;하니 해당 학생들은 기한내에 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br><br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>1. 우선감면 대상자의 장학금 신청<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 재단 홈페이지(</span></font><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">)에서 공인인증서로 로그인 후 신청<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;</font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제출서류 : 없음<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 우선감면 대상자 : </span></font><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">학생 본인이 재단 마이페이지에서 확인 가능<br><br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 우선감면 비대상자(신규신청)<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 재단 홈페이지(</span></font><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)에서 공인인증서로 로그인 후 신청<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제출서류 : 신청서, 서약서, 기타 차상위계층을 확인할수 있는 서류&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (신청서에 기록</span></font><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">되어 있음)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;(출력후 서명하여 학생처로 제출)<br><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">3. 공통사항<br><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 지원금액 : 1학기 : 115만원<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 수혜자격 : 직전학기 취득학점 12학점이상, 평균평점 2.6이상<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011년 2학기부터 희망드림 장학제도는 폐지됨<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 신청대상자 : 재학생, 편입생, 복학생&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2010, 2011학번은 신청대상이 아님)<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 01. 17(월) - 02. 28(월).</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">4. 서류제출장소 : 학생처(본관101호)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(등기접수가능 : 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 학생<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 처(본관101호)&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">5.</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"> 기타 궁금한 사항은 붙임 2011년 1학기 희망드림 장학금 신청 안내 메뉴<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 얼을 참고하시기 바랍니다</font>.<br><br><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font size=\"3\">6. 문의 : 054-478-7045</font></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 37.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">2011년 1월 17일<br><br>금오공과대학교 학생처장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
